      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Miami_Beach%2C_Florida",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "One of South Florida’s first radio stations, WGBU, began broadcasting from a 150‑foot tower in Central Park in 1925.",
